---
/** The AI assistant: how drafts get written, and what it costs. */
---

<section id="claude" class="relative scroll-mt-28 pt-36 md:pt-56" aria-labelledby="claude-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-[48rem] text-center">
      <p class="label">ai assistant</p>
      <h2 id="claude-title" class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[13ch] text-section">Ask for a change, <span class="serif">get a draft back.</span></h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-[40rem] text-lead text-ink-2">
        Connect Claude to Wepilo once. Then ask for what you need, like next season's dates or a Spanish version of a
        trip, and the draft appears in your dashboard for review.
      </p>
      <ul class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-[40rem] gap-3 text-left text-[16px] sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-mist px-5 py-4"><span class="block font-semibold">Works on Claude's free plan</span> <span class="text-muted">Pro (~$20/mo, yours) for heavy use.</span></li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-mist px-5 py-4"><span class="block font-semibold">Set up in minutes</span> <span class="text-muted">Your first request can be “List my trips.”</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
